/Subject (Protections\040of\040the\040Traditional\040Knowledge\040of\040the\040local\040and\040indigenous\040communities\040seem\040to\040be\040one\040of\040the\040most\040contentious\040and\040complicated\040issue\056\040The\040historical\040development\040of\040the\040protection\040of\040intellectual\040property\040in\040the\040wake\040of\040individual\040private\040property\040rights\054\040pushed\054\040the\040traditional\040knowledge\040and\040the\040innovative\040practice\040based\040on\040the\040it\040outside\040the\040purview\040of\040the\040formal\040intellectual\040property\040protection\040regime\056\040The\040need\040to\040protect\040the\040traditional\040knowledge\040captured\040the\040attention\040of\040the\040international\040community\040only\040recently\040but\040the\040standard\040setting\040was\040left\040to\040the\040national\040governments\056India\040an\040abundant\040knowledge\040about\040the\040traditional\040value\040of\040various\040forest\040products\056Natural\040populations\040of\040around\04012\045\040of\040the\0406000\040species\040of\040potentially\040medicinal\040plants\040are\040currently\040estimated\040to\040be\040under\040threat\040due\040to\040degradation\040and\040loss\040of\040habitats\040alongside\040unsustainable\040ways\040of\040harvesting\040and\040lack\040of\040cultivation\056\040Various\040suggestions\040have\040been\040advanced\040in\040India\040to\040extend\040protection\040to\040knowledge\054\040innovations\040and\040practices\056\040These\040include\072\0401\056\040Documentation\040of\040TK\073\0402\056\040Registration\040and\040innovation\040patent\040system\073\040and\0403\056\040Development\040of\040a\040sui\040generis\040system\056\040It\040is\040sometimes\040believed\040that\040proper\040documentation\040of\040associated\040TK\040could\040help\040in\040checking\040bio\055piracy\056\040Documentation\040could\040be\040a\040double\055edged\040sword\056\040It\040is\040assumed\040that\040if\040the\040material\057\040knowledge\040are\040documented\054\040it\040can\040be\040made\040available\040to\040patent\040examiners\040the\040world\040over\040so\040that\040prior\040art\040in\040the\040case\040of\040inventions\040based\040on\040such\040materials\057knowledge\040are\057is\040readily\040available\040to\040them\056)
